@startuml state-machine
!include style.iuml
hide empty description

[*] --> IDLE : install()
IDLE : entry / logIdle()
RUNNING : entry / startMotor()
RUNNING : do / trackRuntime()
RUNNING : exit / logRuntime()
FAULT : entry / raiseAlert()
OFFLINE : entry / notifyTechnician()
MAINTENANCE : do / runDiagnostics()
DECOMMISSIONED : entry / keepLogsOnly()

IDLE --> RUNNING : activate(d) [d > 0 && d <= maxRunMinutes]
RUNNING --> IDLE : deactivate()
RUNNING --> IDLE : after(d) / safety shut-off
IDLE --> FAULT : errorDetected()
RUNNING --> FAULT : errorDetected()
IDLE --> OFFLINE : heartbeatLost()
RUNNING --> OFFLINE : heartbeatLost()
OFFLINE --> IDLE : heartbeatRestored()
OFFLINE --> MAINTENANCE : startRepair()
FAULT --> MAINTENANCE : startRepair()
MAINTENANCE --> IDLE : repairDone() [testPassed]
MAINTENANCE --> MAINTENANCE : repairDone() [!testPassed]
MAINTENANCE --> DECOMMISSIONED : decommission()
DECOMMISSIONED --> [*]
@enduml
